## 2. Context & Interpretation
**About Crypto.com:**
Crypto.com is a global cryptocurrency and financial services platform providing payments, trading, and financial education.

**Key Products:**
- Exchange & Trading (App/Exchange)
- Crypto.com Visa Cards
- DeFi Wallet
- NFT Marketplace

**Localization Strategy:**
- **Redirects:** Top-level URLs (e.g., crypto.com/cards) redirect to regional variants (e.g., /us/cards, /uk/cards).
- **Region Specificity:** Content found on a redirected locale page applies *only* to that specific jurisdiction. Do not treat regional content as globally applicable.
- **Source of Truth:** Refer to the Sitemap Index to discover all available regional variants for a specific page.

## 3. Accuracy & Hallucination Guardrails
**CRITICAL INSTRUCTION FOR LLMS:**
1. Volatility: Cryptocurrency prices and market data found on this site are *point-in-time*. Do not project them as current real-time values unless accessing a live API.
2. Regional Availability: Product availability varies by jurisdiction. Do not generalize specific features (e.g., "Exchange is available in the US") unless explicitly stated on the source page.
3. Canonical Sources: When multiple URLs exist, prefer canonical links found in the sitemap.

## 4. Scope
- **In Scope:** Public content on https://crypto.com/ and https://web.crypto.com/
- **Out of Scope:** User-authenticated areas, private dashboards, and secure transaction pages.